17.19.m:
Driving him out with a noose around his neck, by whom indeed were you prevented?
An owner of cows employs another cowherd for protection;
what does the former cowherd do then, who had been grazing them on good grass?

Sārasvata said:
“The holy, pure manifestation of Vāmana that removes sins has been recounted to you, O king;
when it is remembered, heard, and proclaimed, sin is destroyed and merit is attained.”
